engine/godot/pull/103988.patch","merged_at":"2025-03-17T21:10:42Z"},"body":"For whatever reason the codebase is full of empty constructors and destructors. If a class doesn't have any other constructor, a default public constructor is generated implicitly, so adding explicit one is useless. They aren't even added consistently.\r\n\r\nI've been removing them whenever I spotted in a file I was editing, but this PR just handles them all at once.\r\n\r\nIt's limited to `editor/`, because initially I had a file filter enabled by mistake when searching. Then I realized that outside `editor/` there is twice as much cases, so I left it like that to limit the amount changes.","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103988/reactions","total_count":5,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103988/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}